       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CGDEMO.
      *>====================================================================
      *> Program CGDEMO
      *> Generated by DSPF-RAD from CGDEMO
      *> Records: ORDSFL, ORDSFLC, MENUBAR, PULL1
      *> Edit hint: code inside DSPF-RAD protected-region blocks
      *>            is preserved across regenerations; everything else is
      *>            rewritten when you regenerate from the RAD.
      *>====================================================================
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT CGDEMO ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-CGDEMO-SI
                          ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                          ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                          RELATIVE KEY IS WS-SFL-RRN
                          FILE STATUS IS WS-FILE-STATUS.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  CGDEMO.
       01  CGDEMO-REC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF CGDEMO.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-FLAGS.
           05  DONE-FLG          PIC X       VALUE "N".
           05  WS-FILE-STATUS    PIC X(2)    VALUE "00".
           05  WS-SFL-RRN        PIC 9(5)    COMP-4 VALUE 0.
       01  INDICATORS.
           05  INDIC-TABLE OCCURS 99 PIC 1 INDICATOR 1.
               88  IND-OFF VALUE B"0".
               88  IND-ON  VALUE B"1".

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.

       MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM INITIALIZE-PROGRAM
           PERFORM PROCESS-SCREEN UNTIL DONE-FLG = "Y"
           PERFORM TERMINATE-PROGRAM
           GOBACK
           .

       INITIALIZE-PROGRAM.
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION begin=startup]
      *> Run-once initialisation: open files, fetch parameters, etc.
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION end=startup]
           OPEN I-O CGDEMO
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION begin=prepare-pulldowns]
      *> Populate program-to-system fields used by pulldown choices.
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION end=prepare-pulldowns]
           WRITE CGDEMO-REC FORMAT IS "PULL1"
              INDICATORS ARE INDIC-TABLE
           END-WRITE
           .

       PROCESS-SCREEN.
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION begin=before-display]
      *> Populate fields for the next display operation.
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION end=before-display]
           PERFORM LOAD-SUBFILE
           WRITE CGDEMO-REC FORMAT IS "ORDSFLC"
              INDICATORS ARE INDIC-TABLE
           END-WRITE
           READ CGDEMO FORMAT IS "ORDSFLC"
              INDICATORS ARE INDIC-TABLE
           END-READ
           PERFORM HANDLE-INPUT
           .

       HANDLE-INPUT.
           EVALUATE TRUE
                 WHEN INDIC-TABLE (03) = B"1"
                    MOVE "Y" TO DONE-FLG
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION begin=on-in03]
      *> Add custom handling for IN03 here.
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION end=on-in03]
                 WHEN INDIC-TABLE (05) = B"1"
                    CONTINUE
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION begin=on-in05]
      *> Add custom handling for IN05 here.
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION end=on-in05]
      *> ---- Menu bar actions ----
                 WHEN MNUCHC = 1 AND PULLCHC = 1
      *> Actions > Details
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION begin=mb-actions-details]
                    CONTINUE
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION end=mb-actions-details]
                 WHEN MNUCHC = 1 AND PULLCHC = 2
      *> Actions > History
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION begin=mb-actions-history]
                    CONTINUE
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION end=mb-actions-history]
      *> ---- Push buttons ----
                 WHEN BTNS = 1
      *> Push button: Approve
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION begin=btn-btns-approve]
                    CONTINUE
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION end=btn-btns-approve]
                 WHEN BTNS = 2
      *> Push button: Reject
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION begin=btn-btns-reject]
                    CONTINUE
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION end=btn-btns-reject]
      *> ---- Choice fields ----
                 WHEN RADIO = 1
      *> Radio (RADIO): Open
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION begin=choice-radio-open]
                    CONTINUE
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION end=choice-radio-open]
                 WHEN RADIO = 2
      *> Radio (RADIO): Closed
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION begin=choice-radio-closed]
                    CONTINUE
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION end=choice-radio-closed]
                 WHEN CHKC1 = 1
      *> Check (CHECKS): Urgent
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION begin=choice-checks-urgent]
                    CONTINUE
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION end=choice-checks-urgent]
                 WHEN CHKC2 = 1
      *> Check (CHECKS): Gift
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION begin=choice-checks-gift]
                    CONTINUE
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION end=choice-checks-gift]
                 WHEN OTHER
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION begin=on-enter]
                    CONTINUE
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION end=on-enter]
      *> Changed rows from ORDSFL:
      *> READ SUBFILE NEXT MODIFIED FORMAT IS "ORDSFL".
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION begin=changed-ordsfl]
                    CONTINUE
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION end=changed-ordsfl]
           END-EVALUATE
           .

       LOAD-SUBFILE.
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION begin=load-ordsfl]
      *> Clear the ORDSFL subfile, load it record-by-record,
      *> then turn on SFLDSP / SFLDSPCTL so the SFLCTL renders the loaded
      *> subfile on the next WRITE.
           MOVE B"0" TO INDIC-TABLE (30)
           WRITE CGDEMO-REC FORMAT IS "ORDSFLC"
              INDICATORS ARE INDIC-TABLE
           END-WRITE
           MOVE B"1" TO INDIC-TABLE (30)

           MOVE 0 TO WS-SFL-RRN
      *> Iterate your data source and add records:
      *>   ADD 1 TO WS-SFL-RRN
      *>   ... populate ORDSFL fields ...
      *>   WRITE SUBFILE CGDEMO-REC FORMAT IS "ORDSFL"
      *>      INDICATORS ARE INDIC-TABLE
      *>   END-WRITE

           MOVE B"1" TO INDIC-TABLE (31)
           MOVE B"1" TO INDIC-TABLE (32)
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION end=load-ordsfl]
           .

       TERMINATE-PROGRAM.
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION begin=shutdown]
      *> Cleanup: close files, log, etc.
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION end=shutdown]
           CLOSE CGDEMO
           .
